---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';

const heroImage = 'https://cdn.simplyenak.com/cte-hero-bg.jpg';
---

<Layout title="Food & Heritage Ground Partner in Malaysia" description="Your clients want specific things. Dietary needs that don't map neatly to hawker stalls. Group sizes that don't fit the brochure. We help you say yes. 15 years on the ground in Malaysia." image={heroImage}>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-brand-800 text-white py-24 md:py-32" style={`background: linear-gradient(rgba(42,34,24,0.65), rgba(42,34,24,0.55)), url(${heroImage}) center/cover no-repeat;`}>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">For Travel Professionals</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-white max-w-3xl">
        Your clients want things that don't fit a package. We help you say yes.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/85 max-w-2xl">
        Halal street food with a history angle. A vegan guest who wants to cook Nyonya food. Forty people from four countries with four sets of dietary needs, and dinner is tomorrow. When you have spent 15 years running food experiences across Malaysia, you know which stalls can handle a group of 12, which kitchen will adjust for a vegan guest, and which guide can explain laksa history while managing a gluten allergy at the same table. You bring the client. We handle the details.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="/itineraries/" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">
          View Sample Itineraries
        </a>
        <a href="/partner-with-us/" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-white/50 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
          Partner With Us
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Handle -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">What We Handle</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 max-w-2xl">Whatever your client needs, we can probably build it.</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <a href="/what-we-do/" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border-2 border-accent shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Most Common Request</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Multi-Day Itineraries</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">3 to 7 days of eating through Malaysia. Every stop scouted, every meal tested, every guide trained by us. You sell it, we run it.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/what-we-do/" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Half or Full Day</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Day Experiences</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Morning market walks, afternoon cooking classes, evening hawker crawls. Standalone or bolted onto an existing trip.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/what-we-do/" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">When Standards Don't Fit</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Custom Trips</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Your client's diet, group size, or theme doesn't fit the standard routes. We build something that does. Same depth, different shape.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/what-we-do/" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">For Groups</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Corporate & Events</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Team cooking sessions, incentive trip food stops, gala dinners with local menus. Designed for groups, run by people who know the food.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/what-we-do/" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Just the Plan</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Itinerary Planning</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">You want the local knowledge but you prefer to run things yourself. We plan the route, you operate it.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Sample Itinerary -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">Sample Itinerary</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900">3 Days in Penang</h2>
      <div class="mt-6">
        <img src="https://cdn.simplyenak.com/payload-media/hand-dipping-lumpia-in-penang-laksa.jpg" alt="Dipping fried dough into Penang laksa" class="w-full max-h-96 object-cover rounded-xl" />
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-brand-700 max-w-3xl">A long weekend covering George Town's heritage food, Nyonya home cooking, and the fishing villages along the coast.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Day 1</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">George Town Deep Dive</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Pulau Tikus morning market, Transfer Road roti canai, Little India lunch, Nyonya home restaurant dinner, hawker centre crawl by night.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Day 2</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Markets & Nyonya Kitchen</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Balat morning market, Nyonya cooking class in a home kitchen, afternoon tea at a heritage mansion, sunset at a fishing village.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Day 3</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Fishing Village & Spice Road</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Fishing village breakfast with grilled fish and kerabu, durian farm visit, kampung cooking session, tropical spice garden walk.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="/itineraries/" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">
          View All Itineraries
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trade Kit CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-800 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold">Get the trade kit.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Sample itineraries, pricing structure, destination overviews, partnership terms. Fill in the form and we will send it within 24 hours.</p>
      <form class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center max-w-xl mx-auto">
        <input type="text" placeholder="Your name" required class="flex-1 min-w-48 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white placeholder-white/50 focus:outline-none focus:border-accent" />
        <input type="email" placeholder="Work email" required class="flex-1 min-w-48 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white placeholder-white/50 focus:outline-none focus:border-accent" />
        <button type="submit" class="px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">
          Request Trade Kit
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
